Z||000000||Fiero5||05-08-2001||09:32 AM||||I was following a nice blue MG home yesterday, and realized that my Fiero seemed much bigger compared to that little MG.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Following_blue_MG1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Following_blue_MG2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Following_blue_MG3.jpg"> <P>He must seem like an ant when a tractor trailer comes along. Yeow!||||reg||10
Z||000001||Ken Wittlief||05-08-2001||09:45 AM||||MGs are so small you can reach over and open the passenger door without leaning over<P>using the outside door handle  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Fieros are low to the ground, but they are very wide, measure the outside width of your fiero compaired to a midsize or fullsize sedan or a fullsize truck!<P>thats why we can go around corners like they arnt even there.||||reg||1
