Z||000024||WKDFIRO||05-10-2001||12:28 AM||||My dad has a 74 MGB with the chrome bumpers. It used to AutoX so it is set up for  with 225/15 wheels and a roll bar, twin point ignition by Mallory, stainless steel headers and a Weber carb. I drove it in high school, usually way too fast and loved EVERY second of it! <P>Thats where I got the nack for having the shifter so damn close to the steering wheel. It feels like maybe the same length but Fieros definitely have the Wide Track stance.||||reg||14
